---
// About component refactored for OS window sizing
---
<div class="p-6 md:p-8 space-y-8">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
    <!-- Left Column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-[#4F9DFF]">// 01. MINDSET</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-heading">
          Engineering from first principles.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-text-secondary text-xs leading-relaxed font-sans">
        <div class="space-y-4 border-l border-border-site pl-3">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-[10px] text-white">// 01.1 DECONSTRUCT</h3>
          <p>
            I don't rely on copy-paste abstractions or superficial frameworks without knowing their underlying costs. My building philosophy starts with identifying constraints, breaking down systems to their atomic components, and assembling them cleanly from there.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 border-l border-border-site pl-3">
          <h3 class="font-mono text-[10px] text-white">// 01.2 ENDURANCE</h3>
          <p>
            True product engineering goes beyond making things look nice or writing complex algorithms. It is about understanding users, anticipating performance limits, and engineering solutions that endure.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Column: Decorative Rust Code Panel -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 w-full">
      <div 
        class="tech-border rounded spotlight-card p-4 relative font-mono text-[10px] leading-normal text-text-secondary overflow-hidden"
        id="about-code-card"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border-site pb-2 mb-3 text-[9px] z-10 relative">
          <span class="text-white">// core_mindset.rs</span>
          <span class="text-text-secondary">UTF-8</span>
        </div>

        <pre class="overflow-x-auto text-[#A1A1AA] z-10 relative"><code class="text-white">pub struct <span class="text-[#4F9DFF]">ProductEngineer</span> &#123;
    pub name: String,
    pub philosophy: Philosophy,
    pub constraints: Vec&lt;Constraint&gt;,
&#125;

impl <span class="text-[#4F9DFF]">ProductEngineer</span> &#123;
    pub fn <span class="text-[#4F9DFF]">build</span>(&amp;self) -&gt; Result&lt;System, Error&gt; &#123;
        let base = self.deconstruct_to_atoms()?;
        let pipeline = Pipeline::new()
            .optimize_protocols()
            .minimize_dependencies()
            .ensure_security();
        pipeline.deploy(base)
    }
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  const aboutCard = document.getElementById("about-code-card");
  if (aboutCard) {
    aboutCard.addEventListener("mousemove", (e: MouseEvent) => {
      const rect = aboutCard.getBoundingClientRect();
      const x = e.clientX - rect.left;
      const y = e.clientY - rect.top;
      aboutCard.style.setProperty("--mouse-x", `${x}px`);
      aboutCard.style.setProperty("--mouse-y", `${y}px`);
    });
  }
</script>
